ay BlackJoker now, I take control, then play ♦7. The Landlord will likely beat it and then have 2 cards left. But I\'d be out of cards = I WIN!\n\nReason:\nI should play BlackJoker to take control of the game. After playing it, I\'ll have only ♦7 left. When I gain control from BlackJoker, I\'ll play ♦7 next turn. Even if the Landlord beats my ♦7, I will have already played out all my cards and won the game as a Peasant. This is the winning move.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["BlackJoker"]}'}
